@ApiGateway.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Ping Gateway
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/gateway/ping

### Generate JWT Token
POST {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "1001",
  "userName": "admin",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### Validate Token
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Service Routes
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/gateway/routes

### Get All Services Info (Requires Auth)
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/gateway/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check Individual Service Health (Requires Auth)
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/gateway/services/CashManagement/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Gateway Health Check
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/health

### Gateway Readiness Check
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### Gateway Liveness Check
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Gateway Config (Requires Auth)
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/gateway/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== PROXIED REQUESTS ==========

### Cash Management - Get Cash Units (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cash/cashunits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cash Management - Get Bank Accounts (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cash/bankaccounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Currency Management - Get Currencies (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/currency/currencies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deal Ticketing - Get Deal Batches (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/deals/dealbatches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Loan Management - Get Loans (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/loans/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Organization Setup - Get Roles (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/organization/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Email Notification - Get Email Types (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/email/emailtypes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== GRAPHQL ==========

### Gateway GraphQL - Service Status
POST {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "{ serviceStatus { services { name baseUrl restPrefix graphQlPrefix } } gatewayVersion }"
}

### Gateway GraphQL - Generate Token
POST {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { authenticate(userId: \"1001\", userName: \"admin\", role: \"Admin\") { token tokenType } }"
}

### Cash Management GraphQL (via Gateway proxy)
POST {{ApiGateway.API_HostAddress}}/graphql/cash
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "query": "{ cashUnits { cashUnitId cashUnitName cashUnitCode } }"
}
